id: solar-flare-x100
name: Solar Flare x100
advancement: true
prerequisite: Force Score of 10+
tpCost: 8
# "Increase the Magnitude of Solar Flare's AoE by 1 category" - a Destructive Cone, said on the card. "While an Opponent
# suffers from the Blinded Combat Condition through the effects of Solar Flare, reduce their Clairvoyance Skill Checks by
# 4" - the Solar Flared mark, on the same clock as the Blinded.
flareMagnitudeSteps: 1
flareClairvoyance: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Solar Flare's Cone one Magnitude larger; Blinded by it, Clairvoyance Skill Checks 4 lower.
text: >
  Solar Flare x100: Your blinding flash is larger and brighter.
  –Prerequisites: Force Score of 10+
  –TP Cost: 8
  –Effect: Increase the Magnitude of Solar Flare’s AoE by 1 category. While an Opponent suffers from the Blinded Combat
  Condition through the effects of Solar Flare, reduce their Clairvoyance Skill Checks by 4.
